arm3.staticflickr.com/2872/9961205146_215899db37.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>one of my clone E's actually was bigger than most plants I recently saw in the wild:<br/><img src=\"http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7460/9961207226_3d124d064a.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>clone E:<br/><img src=\"http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7448/9961153635_71f6cbef40.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>clone E:<br/><img src=\"http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7413/9961194756_a79500b79f.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>Clone E:<br/><img src=\"http://farm4.staticflickr.com/3775/9961202356_ce6f65947b.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>Clone E-such a happy plant!<br/><img src=\"http://farm8.staticflickr.com/7290/9961148375_c3d86377d9.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/>",
